    {
     "text": "Bilal was already late. The university bus leaves at 7:30 sharp, and his watch showed 7:28.",
     "who": "Narrator"
    },
    {
     "text": "“Ammi! Have you seen my bag?” he shouted, running down the stairs.",
     "who": "Bilal"
    },
    {
     "text": "“Behind the door, beta. And take a banana — you need energy!”",
     "who": "Ammi"
    },
    {
     "text": "He grabbed the bag, kissed his mother's hand, and ran. The bus was just closing its doors.",
     "who": "Narrator"
    },
    {
     "text": "“Bhai, please! One minute!” Bilal waved his arms.",
     "who": "Bilal"
    },
    {
     "text": "The driver smiled and opened the door. “Running again, Bilal? One day this bus will teach you punctuality.”",
     "who": "Driver"
    },
