    },
    {
     "text": "“Great to meet you too! Thanks for making time. Can I get you a coffee?”",
     "who": "Ayesha"
    },
    {
     "text": "“Sure — black coffee, please.” He sat down. “So, tell me about your work.”",
     "who": "Daniyal"
    },
    {
     "text": "Ayesha took a deep breath. “I help small businesses understand their sales data. Last month I built a dashboard that saved a shop owner six hours every week.”",
     "who": "Ayesha"
    },
    {
     "text": "Daniyal leaned forward. “Six hours a week? Now you have my attention.”",
     "who": "Narrator"
    },
    {
     "text": "“I like numbers that speak,” Daniyal smiled. “Send me a proposal by Friday?”",
     "who": "Daniyal"
    },
    {
     "text": "“Absolutely. You'll have it by Thursday.” Ayesha smiled back — her hands had stopped shaking.",
     "who": "Ayesha"
